    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46111" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαυκίτροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαυκρός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tenderly reared</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζακκί-</span> cod.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζᾰφεγγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <i>very bright</i>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζᾰφελής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <i>violent</i>, with Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς</span>, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιζαφελῶς;῀ πάνυ ἀφελής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζάφελος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				556
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				408.17
			</span></i>.</div>
